OL,3,GNEWSATwo more men arrested over huge
OL,4,Aillegal waste dump
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo more men have been arrested as part
OL,7,Fof an ongoing investigation into a
OL,8,Fgiant illegal waste dump.
OL,10,FThe site in Kidlington, discovered
OL,11,Fbetween the River Cherwell and the A34
OL,12,Fin Oxfordshire last October, contained
OL,13,Fabout 21,000 tonnes of waste in a pile
OL,14,F150m (490ft) long and 6m (20ft) high.
OL,16,FThe rubbish was cleared during a
OL,17,Ffive-month operation costing an
OL,18,Festimated #6m.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
